{"id":"76845edc68eab290","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-konig-lemma.md","title":"Konig Lemma","display":"thm-konig-lemma — Konig Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-konig-lemma","aliases":["58-thm-konig-lemma"],"display":"thm-konig-lemma — Konig Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree9-finitely-branching-tree]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-konig-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-konig-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-konig-lemma — Konig Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a36ff77a4e05962b\" href=\"?note=a36ff77a4e05962b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree9-finitely-branching-tree\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree9-finitely-branching-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega\">../batch16/58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree of finite sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FinitelyBranchingTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FinitelyBranchingTree}_S\\)</span> (finite-branching predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\upharpoonright m\">\\(s\\upharpoonright m\\)</span> (initial segment of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig\\text{-}lemma}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq|s|\\;(s\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(T\\cap\\omega^n\\neq\\varnothing)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FinitelyBranchingTree}_S(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists b\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b\\upharpoonright n\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig\\text{-}lemma}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq|s|\\;(s\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(T\\cap\\omega^n\\neq\\varnothing)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FinitelyBranchingTree}_S(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists b\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b\\upharpoonright n\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every level is explicitly required to be nonempty, and the conclusion is an infinite path rather than merely a maximal finite chain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree9-finitely-branching-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a36ff77a4e05962b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree9-finitely-branching-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"targe